# Herdr stores portable configuration and machine-local runtime state together.
# Keep this directory allowlisted so sessions, logs, sockets, and plugin state
# never enter the dotfiles repository accidentally.
*

!.gitignore
!config.toml

# Optional user-maintained resources referenced by config.toml.
!agent-detection/
!agent-detection/*.toml
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!sounds/
!sounds/**
